/* [JSON Object:dataservice] */
{
	
	"type" : "object",
	"title" : "dataservice",
	"description" : "A collection of operations that provides access to one or more datasets or data processing functions.

URI: dcat:DataService

https://co-cddo.github.io/ukgov-metadata-exchange-model/DataService/

[Mandy describes it like this:

Data Service is a metadata entity describing a logical access endpoint (such as an API, data platform namespace, or object store root) through which Dataset Resources can be accessed. It provides stable service-level metadata including endpoint URL, protocol, authentication, description, and platform details. DatasetResources link to Data Services via an associative table that records dataset-specific logical locations.]",
