			"description" : "A collection of operations that provides access to one or more datasets or data processing functions.  URI: dcat:DataService  https://co-cddo.github.io/ukgov-metadata-exchange-model/DataService/  [Mandy describes it like this:  Data Service is a metadata entity describing a logical access endpoint (such as an API, data platform namespace, or object store root) through which Dataset Resources can be accessed. It provides stable service-level metadata including endpoint URL, protocol, authentication, description, and platform details. DatasetResources link to Data Services via an associative table that records dataset-specific logical locations.]",
			"required" :  [ "resource_identifier","dataservice_endpoint_description","dataservice_endpoint_url","distribution","dataset_dataservice_access" ],
			"properties" : {
		
